  "modules": [
    {
      "textRaw": "定时器 (Timers)",
      "name": "定时器_(timers)",
      "desc": "<p><code>timers</code> 模块提供当前脚本进程内的事件循环定时器, 并提供一组与 <a href=\"workManager\">workManager</a> 兼容的持久化任务入口.</p>\n<p>脚本内定时器是单线程的. 当前脚本长时间阻塞时, 回调只能在事件循环恢复后执行.</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">timers</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] setTimeout",
          "name": "[m]_settimeout",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "setTimeout(callback, delay?, ...args)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "setTimeout",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>Global</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>callback</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#function\">Function</a> } - 定时器到期时执行的函数</li>\n<li><strong>[ delay = 1 ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 等待时间, 单位为毫秒</li>\n<li><strong>...args</strong> { <a href=\"documentation#可变参数\">...</a><a href=\"dataTypes#any\">any</a><a href=\"documentation#可变参数\">[]</a> } - 传给回调的参数</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 定时器 ID</li>\n</ul>\n<p>创建单次定时器.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "callback"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "delay?"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "...args"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] setTimeout"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] setInterval",
          "name": "[m]_setinterval",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "setInterval(callback, delay?, ...args)",
