              "desc": "<p><strong><code>Global</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>callback</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#function\">Function</a> } - 每次定时器到期时执行的函数</li>\n<li><strong>[ delay = 1 ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 间隔时间, 单位为毫秒</li>\n<li><strong>...args</strong> { <a href=\"documentation#可变参数\">...</a><a href=\"dataTypes#any\">any</a><a href=\"documentation#可变参数\">[]</a> } - 传给回调的参数</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 定时器 ID</li>\n</ul>\n<p>创建重复定时器.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "callback"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "delay?"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "...args"
                    }
                  ]
