        {
          "textRaw": "[m] setIntervalExt",
          "name": "[m]_setintervalext",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "setIntervalExt(listener, interval?, timeoutOrCondition?, callback?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "setIntervalExt",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**listener** { [Function](dataTypes#function) } - 每次间隔到期时执行的函数 ",
                      "name": "**listener**",
                      "type": " [Function](dataTypes#function) ",
                      "desc": "每次间隔到期时执行的函数"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**[ interval = 200 ]** { [number](dataTypes#number) } - 间隔时间, 单位为毫秒 ",
                      "name": "**[",
                      "desc": "interval = 200 ]** { [number](dataTypes#number) } - 间隔时间, 单位为毫秒"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**[ timeoutOrCondition ]** { [number](dataTypes#number) | [Function](dataTypes#function) } - 总超时时间或结束条件 ",
                      "name": "**[",
                      "desc": "timeoutOrCondition ]** { [number](dataTypes#number) | [Function](dataTypes#function) } - 总超时时间或结束条件"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**[ callback ]** { [Function](dataTypes#function) } - 结束时执行的回调 ",
                      "name": "**[",
                      "desc": "callback ]** { [Function](dataTypes#function) } - 结束时执行的回调"
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { [number](dataTypes#number) } - 首次调度的定时器 ID ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " [number](dataTypes#number) ",
                      "desc": "首次调度的定时器 ID"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "listener"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "interval?"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "timeoutOrCondition?"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "callback?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>重复执行 <code>listener</code>. 第 3 个参数为正数时, 从调用开始经过指定毫秒数后结束; 为函数时, 每次执行 <code>listener</code> 后计算结束条件. 条件结果不是 <code>null</code>, <code>undefined</code> 或 <code>false</code> 时结束, 并将该结果传给 <code>callback</code>.</p>\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] setIntervalExt"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] keepAlive",
          "name": "[m]_keepalive",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "keepAlive(timeout?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "keepAlive",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>Global</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>[ timeout = 0 ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 保持脚本存活的时间, 单位为毫秒</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 定时器 ID</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>timeout</code> 大于 <code>0</code> 时创建对应时长的空定时器. 省略或不大于 <code>0</code> 时创建每 <code>10000</code> 毫秒执行一次的空定时器, 使脚本持续运行.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "timeout?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] keepAlive"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "持久化任务兼容入口",
          "name": "持久化任务兼容入口",
          "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong></p>\n<p>以下方法委托给 <a href=\"workManager\">workManager</a>. 创建操作始终同步执行, 会忽略 <code>callback</code>, <code>condition</code>, <code>isAsync</code> 和 <code>async</code> 选项. 删除操作返回数据库布尔结果, 与 <a href=\"tasks#m-removetimedtask\">tasks.removeTimedTask</a> 和 <a href=\"tasks#m-removeintenttask\">tasks.removeIntentTask</a> 返回任务对象的语义不同.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "持久化任务兼容入口"
        },
